stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> Provisioning: validate and approve
    Provisioning --> Ready: create and verify
    Provisioning --> Failed: compensate
    Ready --> Active: use
    Active --> Restricted: policy or incident
    Restricted --> Active: remediate
    Active --> Expiring: lifecycle limit
    Expiring --> Retired: cleanup
    Failed --> Retired: reconcile
    Retired --> [*]

